{"id":"mt44u6rqefurjxjd1hh0x5f0b","title":"工作与展示用德国牧羊犬基因差异显现","originalTitle":"Not afraid of ghosts: Curiosity and fearlessness apparent in German shepherd genes","summary":"瑞典乌普萨拉大学和瑞典农业科学大学的研究发现，工作用和展示用德国牧羊犬在行为和基因上存在差异。工作犬表现出更少的恐惧和更多的好奇心，且研究识别出与好奇心和玩耍行为相关的基因。该研究发表在《动物遗传学》期刊上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-ghosts-curiosity-fearlessness-apparent-german.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:34.592Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:34.592Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果","基因治疗"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"f8cc30f3-3001-44f8-b74a-9e3425c0b549","title":"德国牧羊犬工作与展示用品种的行为及基因差异研究"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"f8cc30f3-3001-44f8-b74a-9e3425c0b549","title":"德国牧羊犬工作与展示用品种的行为及基因差异研究"}],"topics":[{"slug":"gene-editing","name":"基因编辑与 CRISPR"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fczRvx8d6f_M","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}